{
 "_": [
  "Map name plates: Data/Local/<pack>/ImgsMapName/<file>. Webzen drew the name",
  "into the bitmap, so translating one means redrawing it - tools/mapBanners.ts",
  "does that, keeping the ornament and replacing only the lettering.",
  "",
  "en is what the shipped English plate reads, for reference; it is never",
  "rendered. The rule is Webzen's own, read off the Spanish plates: descriptive",
  "names are translated (Blood Castle -> Castillo Sangriento) and proper nouns",
  "are kept (Lorencia, Devias, Atlans), transliterated where the script changes.",
  "A language whose entry is missing falls back to the English plate."
 ],
